window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Every Vampire Bloodline has a gift. Eyros Vampires can read and control minds. Kaly Vampires can raise the dead and command your very soul. Wyvern Vampires can teleport from one reality to another. And on it goes.</p> <p>But King Daemon has all of their gifts, plus one more. The Vampires call it Armageddon. No one knows what it is. Until now…</p> <p>NOTE: This is a long serial that is divided into book-length segments. Every single one ends in a cliffhanger. </p> <p>This series is COMPLETE. </p> <p>Narrated by a full cast:</p> <p>Edward Foxwith Adam Riley, Chris Walters, Jay Thelyss, Hannah Hart, Francesca Bianchi, Vanessa Porter, Liz Gentle, Bran Lemieux, Matthew Bissett, and Forrest Smith.</p>"; 
